      "sequence": 942,
      "meaning": "The dense demon army arrives writhing forward, and monkey champions meet it like storm clouds at dissolution. Swords flash as lightning in every direction; elephants, chariots and horses cry like thunderclouds, while monkeys’ tails span the sky like rainbows and dust rises like water. Both sides hurl mountains as if lightning-bolts fell again and again. In anger Rāma pours down arrows and wounds the demon multitude. Struck warriors scream, whirl and fall; blood streams like heavy mountain cascades and gathers into a terrifying river.",
